============================================================
USB LIVE LINK PROBE: JL22 host <> Kozen P12
============================================================
READ-ONLY. This script does not change USB configuration.

Preconditions:
  1. JL22 is connected to THIS Windows PC over ADB.
  2. Kozen P12 is powered on but NOT yet connected to JL22.
  3. Keep the JL22 ADB/service connection to Windows in place.
  4. For the JL22-Kozen link use a FREE USB HOST port on JL22.
  5. On Kozen use the SAME device-side connector/cable that worked
     when Kozen was connected to Windows.

IMPORTANT: do NOT use a USB-A-to-USB-A male cable.
